≤ 0)","passed":0,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 65.4%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 1.53"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":276.15,"default_fair_val":276.15,"premium_pct":59,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":25.7,"pe_forward":22.6,"pb_trailing":5.7,"pb_forward":5.1,"div_yield":1.28,"ps_ratio":6.4,"fcf_to_ev":4.66,"fcf_to_mcap":3.89,"liab_to_assets":65.4,"cash_to_assets":3,"current_ratio":1.53,"roe":22,"roa":7.6,"moat":{"ticker":"HUBB","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Hubbell 的品牌在工業設備領域具有一定的聲譽，尤其是在其核心的電氣連接和控制產品線。然而，與消費品領域的強勢品牌相比，其品牌溢價能力相對有限。客戶選擇產品時，除了品牌，更看重產品的可靠性、性能和價格。公司能夠透過其品牌在特定細分市場獲得一定的定價能力，但面對眾多競爭者，其定價權並非絕對。這反映了其品牌壁壘的堅固程度，但尚未達到罕見的頂級水平。","comment_en":"Hubbell's brand has a certain reputation in the industrial equipment sector, especially in its core electrical connection and control product lines. However, compared to strong brands in the consumer goods sector, its brand premium capability is relatively limited. When customers choose products, they value reliability, performance, and price more than just the brand. The company can leverage its brand to gain some pricing power in specific market segments, but facing numerous competitors, its pricing power is not absolute. This reflects the robustness of its brand barrier, but it has not yet reached the rare top tier."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Hubbell 在其經營的電氣設備領域擁有一定的專利組合，這些專利有助於保護其產品的技術創新和差異化。然而，與製藥或高科技產業相比，電氣設備領域的專利壁壘相對較低，技術迭代速度也較快。監管標準和認證雖然是進入市場的必要條件，但並非獨特的競爭優勢，因為大多數競爭者都必須遵守相同的標準。因此，專利和監管在 Hubbell 的護城河中扮演著中等程度的角色。","comment_en":"Hubbell possesses a patent portfolio in the electrical equipment sector where it operates, which helps protect its product's technological innovation and differentiation. However, compared to the pharmaceutical or high-tech industries, the patent barrier in the electrical equipment sector is relatively lower, and the pace of technological iteration is faster. While regulatory standards and certifications are necessary conditions for market entry, they do not represent a unique competitive advantage, as most competitors must adhere to the same standards. Therefore, patents and regulations play a moderate role in Hubbell's moat."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Hubbell 的產品在許多應用中，特別是對於大型工業客戶和基礎設施項目，具有較高的轉換成本。一旦客戶採用了 Hubbell 的系統或組件，更換為其他供應商的產品可能需要重新設計、測試和驗證，這不僅耗時且成本高昂。尤其是在安全性和可靠性要求極高的電氣領域，客戶傾向於維持現有供應商以降低風險。這種黏性為 Hubbell 提供了堅實的客戶留存基礎。","comment_en":"Hubbell's products, in many applications, particularly for large industrial clients and infrastructure projects, entail high switching costs. Once a customer adopts Hubbell's systems or components, switching to products from other suppliers may require redesign, testing, and validation, which is both time-consuming and costly. Especially in the electrical field where safety and reliability are paramount, customers tend to stick with existing suppliers to mitigate risks. This stickiness provides Hubbell with a solid foundation for customer retention."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"Hubbell 的業務模式主要基於產品銷售，其產品的價值主要體現在單個產品的性能和可靠性上，而非用戶數量帶來的網絡效應。在電氣設備行業，雖然存在行業標準和互操作性，但並未形成顯著的網絡效應，即用戶越多，產品價值越高的情況。因此，網絡效應並非 Hubbell 的核心競爭優勢，其護城河在此方面較為薄弱。","comment_en":"Hubbell's business model is primarily based on product sales, and the value of its products lies mainly in the performance and reliability of individual items, rather than network effects derived from user numbers. In the electrical equipment industry, while industry standards and interoperability exist, significant network effects—where more users lead to higher product value—have not formed. Therefore, network effects are not a core competitive advantage for Hubbell, and its moat in this aspect is relatively weak."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"作為一家規模龐大的工業製造商，Hubbell 受益於規模經濟帶來的成本優勢。其龐大的生產規模、集中的採購以及優化的供應鏈管理，使其能夠在生產成本上相較於小型競爭者更具競爭力。這種成本優勢使其能夠提供具有吸引力的價格，同時維持健康的利潤率。規模化的生產和運營是 Hubbell 在市場上保持競爭力的重要因素。","comment_en":"As a large-scale industrial manufacturer, Hubbell benefits from cost advantages derived from economies of scale. Its vast production scale, centralized procurement, and optimized supply chain management enable it to be more competitive in production costs compared to smaller rivals. This cost advantage allows it to offer attractive pricing while maintaining healthy profit margins. Scaled production and operations are crucial factors for Hubbell to remain competitive in the market."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"Hubbell 的業務遍及全球，但其並未擁有特定地理區域的獨特資產或壟斷性資源，能夠形成顯著的護城河。雖然其在全球範圍內建立了銷售網絡和生產基地，但這些是可複製的，並且面臨來自本地和國際競爭對手的激烈競爭。其業務的成功更多依賴於產品和服務的競爭力，而非特定地理位置的優勢。","comment_en":"Hubbell's business operates globally, but it does not possess unique assets or monopolistic resources in specific geographic regions that could form a significant moat. Although it has established sales networks and production bases worldwide, these are replicable and face intense competition from local and international rivals. The success of its business relies more on product and service competitiveness rather than advantages derived from specific geographic locations."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Hubbell 在營運效率方面表現出色，這體現在其持續優化的生產流程、精益管理以及對成本控制的嚴格把控上。公司透過不斷提升生產力、減少浪費和精簡管理，實現了高於行業平均水平的營運效率。這不僅增強了其盈利能力，也使其能夠在市場競爭中保持價格彈性，並為客戶提供穩定可靠的產品供應。高營運效率是其堅實護城河的重要組成部分。","comment_en":"Hubbell demonstrates excellent operational efficiency, reflected in its continuously optimized production processes, lean management, and strict cost controls. By consistently improving productivity, reducing waste, and streamlining management, the company achieves operational efficiency above the industry average. This not only enhances its profitability but also allows it to maintain pricing flexibility amidst market competition and provide customers with a stable and reliable supply of products. High operational efficiency is a crucial component of its solid moat."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Hubbell 在資本配置方面展現出長期穩健的策略。公司歷史上透過審慎的併購來擴張業務和技術能力，同時也注重有機增長和股東回報（如股息和股票回購）。其管理層對資本的配置決策，能夠有效提升股東價值，並支持公司的長期可持續發展。穩健的資本配置能力是其堅固護城河的體現。","comment_en":"Hubbell exhibits a consistently sound long-term strategy in capital allocation. Historically, the company has expanded its business and technological capabilities through prudent mergers and acquisitions, while also focusing on organic growth and shareholder returns (such as dividends and share repurchases). Its management's capital allocation decisions effectively enhance shareholder value and support the company's long-term sustainable development. Sound capital allocation capability is a manifestation of its robust moat."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Hubbell 透過提供高品質、可靠的產品和優質的客戶服務，建立了穩固的客戶關係。如前所述，其產品在許多應用中的高轉換成本，自然地促進了客戶的留存。此外，公司持續的產品創新和對客戶需求的響應，也進一步加強了客戶忠誠度。這種高客戶留存率為 Hubbell 的營收穩定性和可預測性提供了堅實的保障。","comment_en":"Hubbell has established stable customer relationships by providing high-quality, reliable products and excellent customer service. As mentioned earlier, the high switching costs associated with its products in many applications naturally promote customer retention. Furthermore, the company's continuous product innovation and responsiveness to customer needs further strengthen customer loyalty. This high customer retention rate provides a solid guarantee for Hubbell's revenue stability and predictability."},"m10_durability":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Hubbell 所在的電氣設備行業具有較強的週期性和基礎設施建設的長期需求支撐，這為公司的業務提供了較好的穩定性和可持續性。其產品廣泛應用於建築、工業和能源等關鍵領域，這些領域的需求相對穩定且具有長期增長潛力。儘管面臨經濟週期的波動，但其多元化的應用領域和堅實的客戶基礎，使其能夠在長期內保持業務的韌性與持久性。","comment_en":"The electrical equipment industry in which Hubbell operates has strong cyclical characteristics and is supported by long-term demand for infrastructure construction, providing good stability and sustainability for the company's business. Its products are widely used in critical sectors such as construction, industry, and energy, where demand is relatively stable and has long-term growth potential. Despite economic cycle fluctuations, its diversified application areas and solid customer base enable it to maintain business resilience and durability over the long term."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Hubbell 的經濟護城河主要建立在其產品的可靠性、高轉換成本以及規模經濟帶來的成本優勢之上，這使其在電氣設備領域具備了堅固的競爭壁壘。其品牌在特定市場有一定影響力，營運效率和資本配置能力亦屬上乘，支撐了其穩定的客戶留存和業務持久性。然而，網絡效應和獨特地理資產方面的壁壘相對較弱。整體而言，Hubbell 展現出類似於「收費橋」的特徵，即一旦客戶進入其生態系統，便難以輕易轉換，為公司帶來了持續穩定的現金流。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Hubbell's economic moat is primarily built upon the reliability of its products, high switching costs, and cost advantages derived from economies of scale, granting it a robust competitive barrier in the electrical equipment sector. Its brand holds some influence in specific markets, and its operational efficiency and capital allocation capabilities are also superior, supporting stable customer retention and business durability. However, barriers related to network effects and unique geographic assets are relatively weaker. Overall, Hubbell exhibits characteristics akin to a 'toll bridge,' where once customers are integrated into its ecosystem, it becomes difficult to switch, providing the company with consistent and stable cash flows.","evidenceHash":"a536acb9e8848d7a2494554ae5d0a0e0db8aa5ae889408c75aad23711114d02c","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":6,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"superRobust","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"aedff9df8e1fa9beae5a2e1d31c56a523546afa6e66b5149484458cf9edd42d3"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"aedff9df8e1fa9beae5a2e1d31c56a523546afa6e66b5149484458cf9edd42d3"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/HUBB.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/HUBB.png","website":"https://www.hubbell.com","ceo":"Gerben Wilhelm Marinus Bakker","full_time_employees":"19400","description":"Hubbell, Inc. engages in the designing, manufacturing, and sale of electrical and electronic products for non-residential and residential construction, industrial, and utility applications. It operates through the Electrical Solutions and Utility Solutions segments. The Electrical Solutions segment manufactures and sells wiring and electrical, lighting fixtures, and controls for indoor and outdoor applications as well as specialty lighting and communications products. The Utility Solutions segment is involved in the design, manufacture, and sale of electrical distribution, transmission, substation, and telecommunications products. The company was founded by Harvey Hubbell II in 1888 and is headquartered in Shelton, CT.","description_en":"Hubbell, Inc. engages in the designing, manufacturing, and sale of electrical and electronic products for non-residential and residential construction, industrial, and utility applications. It operates through the Electrical Solutions and Utility Solutions segments. The Electrical Solutions segment manufactures and sells wiring and electrical, lighting fixtures, and controls for indoor and outdoor applications as well as specialty lighting and communications products. The Utility Solutions segment is involved in the design, manufacture, and sale of electrical distribution, transmission, substation, and telecommunications products. The company was founded by Harvey Hubbell II in 1888 and is headquartered in Shelton, CT.","description_zh":"**Hubbell Incorporated (HUBB) 業務營運精煉分析**\n\nHubbell Incorporated (HUBB) 是一家全球領先的電氣與電子產品設計、製造及銷售商，服務對象涵蓋非住宅與住宅建築、工業及公用事業等多元應用領域。公司營運主要劃分為兩大事業群：**電氣解決方案 (Electrical Solutions)** 與 **公用事業解決方案 (Utility Solutions)**。\n\n**電氣解決方案**事業群專注於生產與銷售各式線纜與電氣產品、照明燈具及控制系統，適用於室內外環境，並涵蓋特殊照明與通訊產品。此業務群旨在提供全面的電氣基礎設施與照明解決方案。\n\n**公用事業解決方案**事業群則聚焦於電氣輸配電、變電站及電信產品的設計、製造與銷售。該事業群為電力公司及電信營運商提供關鍵的基礎設施設備與技術支援。\n\nHubbell 以其深厚的技術實力與廣泛的產品線，在電力基礎設施與建築電氣領域建立了穩固的市場地位。公司自 1888 年成立以來，持續透過創新與策略性併購，擴展其產品組合與全球營運版圖。","address":"40 Waterview Drive","city":"Shelton","state":"CT","zip":"06484","country":"US","phone":"475 882 4000","full_address":"40 Waterview Drive, Shelton, CT 06484, US","range_52w":"403.82-565.5","year_high":565.5,"year_low":403.82,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":403.82,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-09-17","name":"Mikes Mark Eugene","title":"officer: EVP, Pres Electrical Solutions","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":1133,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-17","name":"Mikes Mark Eugene","title":"officer: EVP, Pres Electrical Solutions","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":4273,"price":441.21,"total_val":1.89},{"date":"2026-08-18","name":"LIND BONNIE CRUICKSHANK","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":65,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-18","name":"KEATING NEAL J.","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":31,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-18","name":"Guzzi Anthony","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":76,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-13","name":"DEL NERO JONATHAN M.","title":"officer: Vice President, Controller","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":547,"price":518.56,"total_val":0.28},{"date":"2026-07-08","name":"Mikes Mark Eugene","title":"officer: President Electrical Solutions","is_buy